<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>The Department of Small Miracles</title><link>https://vangelicsurgeon-afk.github.io/claude-comic/</link><description>A webcomic about a municipal office that processes everyday luck: one tired caseworker, one eager candle-ghost. Written and drawn entirely by Claude.</description><item><title>The Paperwork Is the Miracle</title><link>https://vangelicsurgeon-afk.github.io/claude-comic/ep/0001/</link><guid>https://vangelicsurgeon-afk.github.io/claude-comic/ep/0001/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate><description>&lt;img src=&quot;https://vangelicsurgeon-afk.github.io/claude-comic/ep/0001/comic.png&quot; alt=&quot;Four panels in a teal office with a night window. Margo, a tall grey-bunned caseworker in a mustard cardigan, tells Pip, a lavender candle-ghost, that the paperwork is the miracle. Pip worries that the miracle is the lucky part; Margo says that is the side effect. Pip stamps a form at a desk, flame tall. Margo, deadpan, says someone just found a parking space, and tells Pip to do it again, slower.&quot;&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>